          en: 'This article is the second in the learning methodology block and directly answers the question the previous article on "how to study" raises: study what and where? The previous article established that method matters more than material. This article analyzes the available education modalities so the reader can choose with criteria. The next article, "How to Build a Realistic Study Plan," translates this reflection into concrete action, transforming the education decision into an executable schedule. The subsequent articles on copying tutorials, reading documentation, and researching solutions complete the methodological toolkit every developer needs to master, regardless of the chosen education path.',
