          en: 'Working professionals use exactly this logic to stay updated. A mid-level developer who wants to learn a new technology doesn\'t try to absorb it in a weekend. They dedicate one hour per day for a month, building progressively more complex projects. Companies that invest in internal training structure programs with this same philosophy: short, frequent sessions, with active practice and immediate application to work.\n\nFor those studying to enter the market, the study plan also works as a demonstration of professional capability. Maintaining a public repository updated weekly with what was studied shows discipline, consistency, and progression. qualities that recruiters value more than certificates. The study plan, when executed with discipline, naturally transforms into a learning portfolio.',
